xplanation": "The correct option connects capability to evidence, control and operating risk.", "option_explanations": ["This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism.", "This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism.", "This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism.", "This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism."]}, {"id": "mcq_07", "kind": "Scenario", "is_critical": false, "question": "What should an architect ask first?", "options": ["Can we call it autonomous?", "Can we skip logs?", "Can we ignore failure modes?", "What can the agent do, with what evidence, under whose approval?"], "answer_index": 3, "explanation": "The correct option connects capability to evidence, control and operating risk.", "option_explanations": ["This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism.", "This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism.", "This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism.", "This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism."]}, {"id": "mcq_08", "kind": "Scenario", "is_critical": false, "question": "Which production failure matters most?", "options": ["Acting on weak or unverified context", "Too much documentation", "Too many examples", "Too much clarity"], "answer_index": 0, "explanation": "The correct option connects capability to evidence, control and operating risk.", "option_explanations": ["This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism.", "This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism.", "This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism.", "This option is unsafe, incomplete, or not tied to the operating mechanism."]}, {"id": "mcq_09", "kind": "Scenario", "is_critical": false, "question": "What should evaluation include?", "options": ["Only fluent response quality",